  _dialogueText: 'That warmth... I recognise it.

    You truly defeated Gor''Vakh.
    And the relic you carry... it is an Emberbound Sigil.

    I thought the last
    of these had been lost when the sanctuaries fell.

    You have done more than
    defeat a corrupted chieftain, traveller. You have returned a fragment of our
    forgotten legacy to the light.

    Please, accept these Lost Embers. You have
    earned my trust... and there is something I must tell you.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: I'm listening, Seraphine.
